          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"stdout\\\": \\\"349:Architecture  & GPT-2-medium / Wiki   & 8/8 & 8/8 & 8/8 & 6/8 & 3/8 & 5/8 & 6/8 \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n351:Scale ($3.4\\\\\\\\times$) & Pythia-1.4B / Wiki (s42) & 7/8 & 6/8 & 8/8 & 5/8 & 0/8 & 0/8 & 5/8 \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\n369:Toda--Yamamoto ranges from 4/8 (Pythia-410M) to 6/8 (OPT-1.3B), with GPT-2-medium at 5/8; cross-architecture TY consistency contrasts with TY instability under Scale and Domain conditions (\\\\\\\\S\\\\\\\\ref{sec:consensus_validation}).\\\\n373:Scaling from 410M to 1.4B parameters (3.4$\\\\\\\\times$) preserves the lead-lag signal across two seeds: s42 reaches $K{\\\\\\\\geq}4/5$ in 5/8 pairs, s43 in 6/8 pairs.\\\\n\\\", \\\"stderr\\\": \\\"\\\", \\\"return_code\\\": 0}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {\\\"elapsed_seconds\\\": 0.43}}\"}"
